# English language

Write all project artifacts in **English**:

- Source code, comments, and docstrings
- Markdown specs under `docs/`
- Commit messages and pull request descriptions
- Variable names and user-facing strings in code

The user may chat in Spanish or other languages; still produce English deliverables unless they explicitly ask for another language in the artifact itself.

When editing `docs/` files that still contain Spanish, translate them to English or add an English section and mark legacy text as superseded.
